		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Corrupted marid. Purplish man-shaped figure bristling with sea urchin spines, with an elongated lamprey face. Agonized by tolling of bells.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 spear +5 (2d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Boiling Sea</strong>. Instead of attacks, boil water within double near centered on div. All except div, CON 12+ or 1d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Quills</strong>. Creatures touching or striking ghawwa in melee take 1d6 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
